      "bullets": [
        "Formal languages and DSLs function as engineered representations, constraining LLM probability distributions for improved accuracy and deterministic output execution.",
        "Custom symbolic syntax minimizes context window consumption and optimizes tokenization efficiency compared to natural language prompts in transformer models.",
        "Structuring synthetic datasets with tailored formal semantics improves model chain-of-thought reasoning and embedding precision during fine-tuning."
      ]
